  "body_html": "<p>Be sure to check out the StockTok tracker for more information. If you have questions, just ping me in the chat. Thanks for stopping by 👍 </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-winning-stocks-to-dca-up?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/2-winning-stocks-to-dca-up?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p><div class=\"digest-post-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;nodeId&quot;:&quot;f46331f8-1381-496b-98d0-eef5f5e24d9b&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;This document will be updated at least weekly, you can see the “Last Update” in the subtitle. Changes will be Bold and Italicized. Stocks will be labeled: “In 📈” if I bought or shorted, or “watching 👀” if they are just on my radar. Each stock will be labeled with entry price/range and stop price/range. Additionally, these will be noted, a brief summary, for WHY I like them or dislike them. Note that many of my charts and stocks are based off the weekly, as this timeframe allows people time to make decisions on their own. There will be NO DAY TRADES ❌&quot;,&quot;cta&quot;:null,&quot;showBylines&quot;:true,&quot;showDescription&quot;:true,&quot;showImage&quot;:true,&quot;size&quot;:&quot;lg&quot;,&quot;isEditorNode&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;📈 Timothy's Stocks 📉&quot;,&quot;publishedBylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:301052325,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;StockTok&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Economist and investor providing daily updates TikTok: 565,000 followers. &quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;,&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:100